# Keep LF in the repo and in the working tree. Windows' core.autocrlf=true would
# otherwise hand us CRLF files, and a CRLF-only edit then shows up as a whole-file
# rewrite in the diff.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
